# ---- Rust / Cargo ----
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# Platform server build artifacts (rebuild with `cargo build` inside platform/)
platform/target/

# ---- Build artifacts / generated files ----
# Cascades converted from OpenCV XML via tools/convert_opencv_xml.py are local
# build products — EXCEPT the one shipped in assets/, which is a versioned
# source artifact embedded into the binary via include_bytes! (see
# assets/NOTICE.md for the pinned source hash).
*.rfcf
!assets/*.rfcf

# ---- Local-only user state ----
.claude/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- Tooling scratch ----
/scratch/
/tmp/
*.tmp
*.bak

# ---- Test outputs ----
test_output/
test_out/
out/
rsface-demo/
*.out.png
*.test.png

# ---- Generated test data ----
# Frames extracted from test videos and binary fixtures used only by local
# reproducers. Generated, not hand-edited.
/fixtures/generated/
data
__pycache__/

# ---- External skills (unrelated to rs-face) ----
# Skills installed via skillhub live under .claude/skills/ (e.g.
# kwai-lever-drama-transport-download, pulled from domain
# 929d85b1-8c16-40af-b837-086589417f5e). The `.claude/` entry above already
# covers them; this block is documentation only.

# ---- Platform test fixtures: large binaries only ----
# Small reference images (lena/two-people/biden jpgs) are checked in;
# the large mp4/HLS fixtures are not.
platform/testdata/*.mp4
platform/testdata/hls-loop/

# ---- node_modules / vite build output ----
# `pnpm install` populates node_modules/ for the dev-only Vite proxy
# (package.json + vite.config.js at the repo root, root: platform/web).
# Production ships platform/web/ directly inside the rsface-server image —
# this is purely for `make web-dev` hot-reload iteration.
node_modules/
web-dist/
.vite/

# ---- Local model weights (fetch via tools/fetch_models.sh) ----
models/

# ---- Local tooling / OS junk ----
.meta.yaml
._.DS_Store
**/._.DS_Store
.DS_Store

# ---- Personal task tracking (not part of the project) ----
TASK_PLAN.md
*_plan.md

# ---- Personal / one-off scratch tooling (NOT project code) ----
# Personal jsdom + screenshot scripts hardcoded to local nvm / playwright
# caches. Local validation scripts only — they reference absolute paths
# (`/mnt/ssd/cache/...`, `/home/hyx/.cache/...`) and never run on CI.
platform/scripts/web-accept.cjs
platform/scripts/web-shots.cjs
# Intermediate screenshot / DOM artifact from the above tools
platform/web/.__light.html
/tmp/rsface-shots/
